## Summary

Replaces the retry loop in `fetch` with exponential
backoff, as discussed in #123. See also
https://example.com/design-doc.

### Checklist

[x] Tests added
[ ] Docs updated
[x] Changelog entry
    ◦ under Unreleased
    ◦ with a link

## How to test

1. Run the server.
2. Kill the network:
      sudo ifconfig en0 down
3. Watch it back off.

│ Note The old behaviour hammered the API — see the graph
│ below.

[image: latency graph]

▾ Benchmark results

case  before  after
────  ──────  ─────
cold   120ms   80ms
warm    40ms   38ms

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Closes #123. 日本語のメモ：再試行の間隔は指数的に伸びます。
Thanks!

